    "name": "Anura Partners",
    "tagline": "Independent Strategy Consulting Boutique bridging Europe and Africa",
    "description": "Most consultants diagnose problems they’ll never have to fix.\n\nThe industry is built on pointing, not solving. Companies receive reports full of direction but no delivery because many consultants either do not understand implementation or avoid it. They hide behind intellectual brilliance while practical solutions go untouched. Clients learn the hard way that value comes from solving the problem, not admiring it.\n\nWe reject the split between strategy and execution. Strategy is only useful when it becomes action. A plan that cannot be implemented is a distraction, and a consultant who hands it over and disappears adds cost, not value.\n\nAt Anura Partners, we work with clients to uncover their real challenges, design strategies their organisations can actually run, and then stay until the solution works in practice. Some know us for our rail expertise, but our true strength is taking a problem end to end across industries and delivering the outcome, not the presentation.\n\nTeams come to us because they want clarity, progress, and profitability. They want something fixed, not described. We make that happen by staying close, staying practical, and refusing to stop at the slide deck.\n\nWe turn strategy into results because that is the only place value lives.",
